[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2027-utrecht-excellence-scholarships-ues-in-netherlands-for-international-students-178":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},178,"2027-utrecht-excellence-scholarships-ues-in-netherlands-for-international-students-178","2027 Utrecht Excellence Scholarships (ues) In Netherlands For International Students","\u003Cp>The Utrecht Excellence Scholarships will cover the tuition fee of all awardees plus the income required for a period of one year linked to a residence permit for study.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Utrecht University is seeking to support international students with a fully-funded bachelor’s, or postgraduate Master’s scholarship.  \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Utrecht Excellence Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Utrecht University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Geographic Reference\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: February 1st Every Year\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2027 Utrecht Excellence Netherlands Scholarships (UES) Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for a Utrecht Excellence Netherlands Scholarship (UES), you must meet the following criteria:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must belong to the top 10% of your graduating class.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must not hold an EU\u002FEEA passport and not be eligible for support under the Dutch study grant and loan system.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must have completed your secondary school and\u002For bachelor’s degree outside the Netherlands.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must have applied for an international bachelor’s or master’s programme with a start date of 1 September 2027. Not all programmes participate.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2027 Utrecht Excellence Scholarship Benefits and Timeline\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Utrecht Excellence scholarship can be awarded as:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University application assistance\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>the tuition fee, or\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>the tuition fee plus the income required for a period of one year linked to a residence permit for study as determined by the IND (Immigration and Naturalisation Service).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Selection Criteria for Utrecht University Scholarships\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Eligible candidates will be selected for a scholarship based on the following criteria:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic quality and promise in the proposed field of study, as evidenced by your master’s application. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic excellence, as evidenced by proof of belonging to the top 10% of your graduating class (class ranking certificate, GPA with grade distribution summary, statement\u002Freference letter signed and stamped by your university).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The quality and relevance of your motivation letter for the master’s programme (academic content, intercultural and communication skills, personal motivation).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The quality of the application for the master’s programme itself (completeness, accuracy, consistency).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Geographic Reference\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for 2027 Utrecht Excellence Scholarships in Netherlands\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>After submitting an application (or applications) for a UES-eligible bachelor’s or master’s programme before the stated deadline, non-EU\u002FEEA students will have the opportunity to submit an application for \u003Cstrong>one \u003C\u002Fstrong>Utrecht Excellence Scholarship \u003Cstrong>from 1 November 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will see the UES application(s) in your OSIRIS Online Application account dashboard. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click \u003Cem>view\u002Fedit\u003C\u002Fem> for the UES linked (related process) to the programme you wish to apply for, upload the requested proof of belonging to the top 10% of your class or personal statement form, answer the questions, and submit the application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prospective students who wish to be considered for the scholarship must apply \u003Cstrong>before\u003C\u002Fstrong> \u003Cstrong>February 1st 23:59 CET\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The application portal will close at this time. Selection will only start after the deadline. The results will be published by mid-Apri\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPPLY FOR UNDERGRADUATE:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uu.nl\u002Fen\u002Fbachelors\u002Fgeneral-information\u002Fhow-to-apply\u002Fscholarships-and-grants\u002Futrecht-excellence-scholarships\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uu.nl\u002Fen\u002Fbachelors\u002Fgeneral-information\u002Fhow-to-apply\u002Fscholarships-and-grants\u002Futrecht-excellence-scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE FOR MASTERS: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uu.nl\u002Fen\u002Fmasters\u002Fgeneral-information\u002Fapplication-and-admission\u002Fscholarships-and-grants\u002Futrecht-excellence-scholarships\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uu.nl\u002Fen\u002Fmasters\u002Fgeneral-information\u002Fapplication-and-admission\u002Fscholarships-and-grants\u002Futrecht-excellence-scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-24 12:07:09",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2027-utrecht-excellence-scholarships-ues-in-netherlands-for-international-students\u002F69eb4edd153086.47225202_screenshot 2026-04-24 115751.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2027-utrecht-excellence-scholarships-ues-in-netherlands-for-international-students\u002F69eb4edd153086.47225202_screenshot%202026-04-24%20115751.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":48},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[44],{"fileName":45,"oldFileName":45,"type":18,"file":19,"url":46},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot%202026-06-24%20201924.png","2026-06-24 20:40:26","linkskool",{"id":50,"slug":51,"title":52,"images":53,"datePosted":57,"authorName":9},303,"chevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity","Chevening Scholarship 2027 Award In Uk: Fully Funded Opportunity",[54],{"fileName":55,"oldFileName":55,"type":18,"file":19,"url":56},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fchevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c2d59792500.64054757_screenshot 2026-06-24 181051.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fchevening-scholarship-